MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_001: Hah! Hyah!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_002: Workin' out again? It's like you never quit.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_003: I like training—getting stronger and stronger!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_004: Back where I grew up, all we did was fight.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_005: That's kinda how it was in my village—the stronger\nyou were, the better. But probably not the same.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_006: I'm from the Asherah clan. Fighting's been a part\nof our people forever.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_007: It's part of everything we do. Even our festival\ndancing, which is based on wrestling moves!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_008: Wow, wrestle-dancing? Sounds great. Can I see?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_009: Yeah, sure! I'm a little rusty though.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_010: Hyeh! Huh! Hyaah!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_011: Like that, see? But hooo boy—I bet that looks\npretty weird outside of my village.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_012: That was so...violent! You looked amazing. I almost\ncaught myself joinin' in.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_013: Want to give it a try? Big ox like you—I bet you'd\nbe pretty great at it!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_014: I don't know 'bout that. But sure, why not! Can ya\nshow me the moves?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_015: First move, hold your right arm out like thiiis.\nSecond move, left leg back like thiiis.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_016: OK, OK, I think I get it. You do a little of this\nand then...like this?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_017: Yeah, perfect! I knew you'd be a natural!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_018: Let's do it together now. It's based on fighting,\nright? So it's meant to flow with two people.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_019: Sure, that makes sense. Let's give it a try!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_020: OK, I'll start. Counter me as we go! 
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_021: Umph! Hyeh! Not easy tryin' to match up\nour moves...
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_022: Ha! An opening! Yaa-aaah!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_023: Ow! Hey, what was that for? You punched me!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_024: Aw, sorry! You danced yourself into a vulnerable\nspot. My fist couldn't help itself!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_025: Gotta say I love a good fist fight! I wouldn't mind\nsome real sparring right about now...
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_C_026: Yeesh. I ain't great at dancing, but I know not to hit\nsomeone during it.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_001: Hey, Goliath! I want to know something. What\nare the festivals in your village like?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_002: Huh? Where'd that come from?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_003: I just want to know. I showed you my clan's\nfestival dances, didn't I?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_004: I don't really wanna talk about it. Not that there'd be\nmuch to tell if I did.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_005: Sorry, buddy. Now I really gotta know.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_006: My tribe all hated me. When they'd have events\nand stuff, I wasn't allowed to go.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_007: So yeah, festivals... Don't think I ever went to one.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_008: Ohhh... So you've never...
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_009: What? Don't go and start pitying me. I didn't ask\nfor that.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_010: Hang on. Are you telling me— Hahaha!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_011: HEY! I didn't ask ya to laugh at me, either!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_012: Aw, hey. I didn't mean to make fun of you.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_013: I just can't believe it. If you grew up in my clan,\nyou would've NEVER been left out.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_014: You would've been our most popular guy! I mean,\nLOOK at you.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_015: You... You think so?
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_016: Like I said, my clan's all about fighting. Big guy\nlike you would be a hero to all the kids!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_017: Not to mention...you'd have to fight off a lot of men\nand women who'd want a piece of you.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_018: A hero. I kinda like the sound of that.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_019: Yeah, you'd be someone real special, compared\nto the guys back home.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_020: I mean, they don't have much to say. Kind of brutes,\ncompared to you.
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_021: So a big ox like you has got a lot to offer. You've\ngot size, strength...and depth!
MID_SE_Gol_Noc_B_022: OK, now I feel like you are teasin' me. Hehehe.\nThat is WAY too many compliments!